# Folder Structure Template (.fst / .txt)
#
# Indentation rules:
# - 1 level = 1 TAB OR 2 spaces
# - Do not mix TABs and spaces on the same line
# - Use consistent indentation
#
# Notes:
# - Spaces inside folder names are allowed
# - Lines starting with # are comments
#
# Example:
# RootFolder
#   SubFolder
#     ChildFolder


RootFolder
  SubFolder
    ChildFolder